# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type | title }})

Get information on a checkout policy.

## Example Usage

```terraform
# Get information about a specific checkout policy
data "wallix-bastion_checkout_policy" "secure" {
  checkout_policy_name = "secure_checkout"
}

# Use the checkout policy in a domain account
resource "wallix-bastion_domain_account" "service_account" {
  domain_id             = wallix-bastion_domain.corporate.id
  account_name          = "service-user"
  account_login         = "svc-account"
  checkout_policy       = data.wallix-bastion_checkout_policy.secure.checkout_policy_name
}

# Validate lock duration settings before reusing the policy elsewhere
output "checkout_policy_info" {
  value = {
    enable_lock  = data.wallix-bastion_checkout_policy.secure.enable_lock
    duration     = data.wallix-bastion_checkout_policy.secure.duration
    max_duration = data.wallix-bastion_checkout_policy.secure.max_duration
    extension    = data.wallix-bastion_checkout_policy.secure.extension
  }
}
```

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Usage Notes

### Lookup Key

- **checkout_policy_name**: The name of the checkout policy to look up. Returns an error if no policy with this name exists.

### Returned Attributes

- **description**: Description of the policy
- **enable_lock**: Whether checkout locking is enabled (exclusive access with time limits) versus basic checkout (no time limits, multiple simultaneous checkouts possible)
- **change_credentials_at_checkin**: Whether the password is automatically rotated when checked back in (only meaningful when `enable_lock` is `true`)
- **duration**: Initial checkout duration in seconds
- **extension**: Duration of each extension request in seconds
- **max_duration**: Maximum total duration including extensions, in seconds

### Usage in Resources

Reference the policy name in resources such as `wallix-bastion_domain_account` or `wallix-bastion_device_localdomain_account` to assign it. If a resource does not specify a checkout policy, it defaults to the "default" policy on the Bastion.
